# Planted bugs for the fencing design. Each one must make its property fail.
run fv-tlc LeaseFencing.tla Fencing.cfg WitnessGranted.cfg
properties StaleWriteRejected EventuallyGranted
file LeaseFencing.tla

mutation the grant records the old token instead of the fresh one
detects StaleWriteRejected
-     /\ storageToken' = IF Order = "fencing" THEN leaseToken + 1 ELSE storageToken
+     /\ storageToken' = IF Order = "fencing" THEN leaseToken ELSE storageToken

mutation a lease that expires never gets granted to anyone
detects EventuallyGranted
-     /\ expired' = TRUE
+     /\ expired' = FALSE

harmless a comment on the grant action
- \* higher token. The fencing design records that token as the high mark now,
+ \* higher token. The fencing design records this token as the high mark now,
